rpki-prover is an RPKI relying party: it downloads the RPKI repositories
of the five Regional Internet Registries (AFRINIC, APNIC, ARIN, LACNIC
and RIPE NCC) over RRDP and rsync, validates the certificates, manifests,
ROAs, ASPAs and router certificates in them, and serves the result to
routers over the RPKI-to-Router protocol (RFC 8210) and to people and
scripts over an HTTP API with a web UI.
